{"answers":[{"display":"Q19","label":"Appropriateness of the TWG subgroup formula","qid":"Q019","selections":["Yes"],"shorthand":"formula_appropriate","text":null,"type":"single_select"},{"display":"Q20","label":"Why the formula is or is not appropriate","qid":"Q020","selections":[],"shorthand":"formula_appropriate_why","text":"The formula takes into account the primary and the significant secondary effects for calculating the project GHG reductions approach compares emissions in a baseline scenario, considering the marginal emission rates, the emissions in the project scenario and the specific emission rate of the project.","type":"free_text"},{"display":"Q21","label":"Include secondary effects in quantification","qid":"Q021","selections":["Yes"],"shorthand":"secondary_effects_include","text":null,"type":"single_select"},{"display":"Q22","label":"Secondary effects to consider, and how","qid":"Q022","selections":[],"shorthand":"secondary_effects_which","text":"only significant secondary effects are to be considered","type":"free_text"},{"display":"Q24","label":"Annual versus lifetime impact reporting","qid":"Q024","selections":["Reported each year"],"shorthand":"reporting_period_choice","text":null,"type":"single_select"},{"display":"Q25","label":"Why annual or lifetime reporting","qid":"Q025","selections":[],"shorthand":"reporting_period_why","text":"for ease of comparison and calculation of emissions impacts","type":"free_text"},{"display":"Q26.1","label":"Requiredness of the regulatory test","qid":"Q026_1","selections":["Required"],"shorthand":"addl_regulatory_req","text":null,"type":"matrix_rating"},{"display":"Q26.2","label":"Requiredness of the timing test","qid":"Q026_2","selections":["Required"],"shorthand":"addl_timing_req","text":null,"type":"matrix_rating"},{"display":"Q26.3","label":"Requiredness of the financial analysis test","qid":"Q026_3","selections":["Optional"],"shorthand":"addl_financial_analysis_req","text":null,"type":"matrix_rating"},{"display